<strong style="font-size: 15px">Shout-outs</strong>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center">
<img src="/images/employee-brand/31d329668427.webp" alt="Omar" style="width: 38px; height: 38px; flex: none; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 36% 30%">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><strong style="font-size: 12px">Omar R. · Elm St. branch</strong><span>from Marcus, Lending</span></div>
</div>
<span>Stayed after close to help a customer unlock a frozen account. Absolute legend.</span>
<div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; gap: 6px; font-weight: 800"><span style="background: #fff4d6; border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 8px">Kudos 24</span><span style="background: #fff4d6; border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 8px">Replies 9</span></div>
</div>
<div style="background: #1a1426; color: #fff4d6; border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<strong style="font-size: 15px">New on the team</strong>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 6px">
<img src="/images/employee-brand/da3dd06c24c6.webp" alt="Luis" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #ff6b4a">
<img src="/images/employee-brand/1d90eea5cb69.webp" alt="Ben" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #ff6b4a">
<img src="/images/employee-brand/b4db42b2f2c8.webp" alt="Mia" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #ff6b4a">
<img src="/images/employee-brand/ceae12d7a029.webp" alt="Ruby" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #ff6b4a">
</div>
<span>Luis, Ben, Mia and Ruby joined branches across the region this week. Say hi in the Feed.</span>
<span style="margin-top: auto; align-self: flex-start; background: #7be0d0; color: #1a1426; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 10px; font-weight: 800">Say hi</span>
</div>
<div style="background: #7be0d0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<strong style="font-size: 15px">Community Day vote</strong>
<span>Help pick where we volunteer. Votes close Friday, 3 pm.</span>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-weight: 800"><span>City food bank</span><span>62%</span></div><div style="height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: #ffffff99"><div style="width: 62%; height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; background: #1a1426"></div></div></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-weight: 800"><span>Riverside cleanup</span><span>38%</span></div><div style="height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: #ffffff99"><div style="width: 38%; height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; background: #1a1426"></div></div></div>
<span style="margin-top: auto; font-weight: 800">143 votes so far</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="position: absolute; left: 330px; top: 514px; width: 148px; height: 44px; background: #000"></div>
<div style="position: absolute; left: 270px; top: 558px; width: 268px; height: 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: #000"></div>
<div style="position: absolute; left: 704px; top: 130px; width: 216px; height: 460px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #000; border-radius: 30px; padding: 10px; box-shadow: 0 24px 48px #00000080">
<div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background: #fff4d6; border-radius: 22px; overflow: hidden; padding: 18px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 20.5C8 15 12 11 19.5 4.5" fill="none" stroke="#1a1426" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M11.5 12.5C7 13 4 11 3.5 6.5 8 6 11 8.5 11.5 12.5Z" fill="#1a1426"></path><path d="M15 9C14.5 5 16.5 2.5 21 2.5 21 7 18.5 9.5 15 9Z" fill="#1a1426"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800">The Branch</span></div>
<span style="font-size: 25px; line-height: .98; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.8px; color: #c4361b">Hey Sam, doors open at 9.</span>
<div style="background: #ff6b4a; border-radius: 14px; padding: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.25">
<img src="/images/employee-brand/2da35ad6294e.webp" alt="A teller smiling as he hands cash to a customer" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 86px; border-radius: 10px; object-fit: cover; object-position: 62% 62%">
<strong style="font-size: 13px">Raj at Elm St.: five stars all month</strong><span>Kudos 41 · see the reviews</span>
</div>
<div style="background: #1a1426; color: #fff4d6; border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.25; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center"><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><strong style="font-size: 13px">Community Day</strong><span>Volunteer sign-ups open</span></div><span style="font-family: Caveat, cursive; font-size: 20px; color: #ffd458; line-height: 1">12 days</span></div>
<div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-around; border-top: 1px solid #1a142626; padding-top: 7px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800"><span>Feed</span><span>People</span><span>Toolbox</span><span>Me</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="position: absolute; left: 790px; top: 10px; width: 170px; font-family: Caveat, cursive; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 700; color: #ffd458; transform: rotate(-3deg)">same brand, turned inward</div>
<svg width="60" height="50" viewBox="0 0 60 50" fill="none" stroke="#ffd458" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 800px; top: 78px"><path d="M40 4C34 22 26 32 12 42"></path><path d="M12 42l4-13M12 42l13-3"></path></svg>
</div>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #c9c7f2; text-align: center">ACME is a sample brand.</p>
</div>
</section>

<!-- INSIGHT -->
<section style="background: #fbfaf5">
<div style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 56px">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(420px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 32px 56px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Archivo, sans-serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1px; text-wrap: balance">They know your logo by heart. <em style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 700; color: #362dff">Do they know what it stands for?</em></h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; color: #000">
<p style="margin: 0">Your people sell under your brand, ship it and answer the phone with it. The public identity is the most familiar thing in the building, so showing it back to them on the intranet adds nothing new.</p>
<p style="margin: 0">What often gets lost is the meaning behind it: the purpose, the story, why the work matters. That's what an employee brand is for. It takes the brand everyone already recognizes and speaks to the people inside.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 24px 48px; background: #05006c; color: #fff; border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px 44px">
<span style="font-family: Archivo, sans-serif; font-size: 112px; line-height: .9; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -4px; color: #ffd458">41%</span>
<div style="flex: 1 1 380px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: Archivo, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 800">of U.S. workers strongly agree they know what their company stands for and what makes its brand different.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #e1e0fa">Among front-line employees in financial services, it's just 22%.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #c9c7f2">Source: Gallup, survey of 3,000+ U.S. workers</p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 28px">
<div style="background: #fff; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; transform: rotate(-1.5deg); box-shadow: 0 14px 28px #05006c26">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 700">Welcome</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #33325a">A name and voice that sound like colleagues, not a press release. New hires feel part of something from day one.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #ffd458; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; transform: rotate(1deg); box-shadow: 0 14px 28px #05006c26">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: Caveat, cursive; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 700">Engaged</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px">Room for humor, rituals and inside references: the things your public brand could never say out loud.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #fff; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; transform: rotate(-.75deg); box-shadow: 0 14px 28px #05006c26">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: Archivo, sans-serif; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1px; color: #362dff">ALIGNED</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #33325a">A shared story that connects everyday work to the company's goals and purpose.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- STICKY -->
<section id="sticky" style="background: #fff">
<div style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 48px">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(420px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 32px 56px; align-items: center">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.2px; color: #362dff">After launch day</p>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Archivo, sans-serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1px; text-wrap: balance">Most intranets peak at launch. <em style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 700; color: #362dff">Yours should keep growing.</em></h2>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #000">A new intranet gets a burst of curiosity on day one. Then the novelty fades, visits slide, and an expensive platform quietly becomes the place nobody checks.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #000">More features rarely fix that. A reason to belong does. When the intranet has its own name, voice and rituals, it stops being "the intranet" and becomes a place people go: "it's on the Branch."</p>
</div>
<figure style="margin: 0; background: #fbfaf5; border-radius: 24px; padding: 28px 28px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<svg viewBox="0 0 560 250" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative chart: visits to a typical intranet spike at launch and then fall away, while visits to an intranet with an employee brand hold steady and grow over twelve months" style="display: block; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace">
<line x1="40" y1="205" x2="545" y2="205" stroke="#05006c" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-width="2"></line>
<line x1="40" y1="20" x2="40" y2="205" stroke="#05006c" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-width="2"></line>
<path d="M40 200 C62 200 74 34 96 34 C126 34 150 150 220 172 S400 190 545 192" fill="none" stroke="#8f8cb8" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="2 9"></path>
<path d="M40 200 C62 200 78 66 100 66 C138 66 168 104 238 98 S420 66 545 34" fill="none" stroke="#362dff" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
<circle cx="545" cy="34" r="7" fill="#ffd458" stroke="#362dff" stroke-width="3"></circle>
<text x="545" y="20" text-anchor="end" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#362dff">With an employee brand</text>
<text x="545" y="180" text-anchor="end" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#5b5880">Typical launch</text>
<text x="40" y="228" font-size="13" fill="#33325a">Launch</text>
<text x="545" y="228" text-anchor="end" font-size="13" fill="#33325a">Month 12</text>
<text x="30" y="112" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="#33325a" transform="rotate(-90 30 112)">Visits</text>
</svg>
<figcaption style="font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #33325a">Illustrative, not client data.</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(240px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 20px">
<div style="background: #fbfaf5; border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#362dff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4"></path></svg>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: Archivo, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 900">Rituals to return for</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #000">Named series, events and traditions give people a reason to check in every week, not just on launch day.</p>
<p style="margin: auto 0 0; font-family: Caveat, cursive; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.05; color: #362dff">Community Day, Monday kudos, coffee with the CEO</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #fbfaf5; border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#362dff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"></circle><path d="M2.5 20c.8-3.6 3.4-5.5 6.5-5.5s5.7 1.9 6.5 5.5"></path><circle cx="17.5" cy="9" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M17 14.5c2.4.2 4 1.8 4.5 4.5"></path></svg>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: Archivo, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 900">People see their people</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #000">Shout-outs, new-hire welcomes and real photos of real colleagues. Nothing pulls people back like seeing their own team.</p>
<p style="margin: auto 0 0; font-family: Caveat, cursive; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.05; color: #362dff">Omar's shout-out: 24 kudos by lunch</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #fbfaf5; border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#362dff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"></path><path d="M8 9.5h8M8 12.5h5"></path></svg>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: Archivo, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 900">An invitation to join in</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #000">A voice that asks instead of announces. Polls, comments, reactions and stories employees share themselves.</p>
<p style="margin: auto 0 0; font-family: Caveat, cursive; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.05; color: #362dff">143 votes on where to volunteer</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #fbfaf5; border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#362dff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.3-5.7"></path><path d="M20 4v5h-5"></path></svg>
